# BUG-010 — the native platform PROJECTS (android/, ios/, web/, …) are TRACKED.
# They are hand-edited source, not scaffold: android/ carries the CAMERA +
# USE_BIOMETRIC permissions (D-404 / D-738), android:networkSecurityConfig with
# the pinned res/raw/simf_api_cert.pem (D-768), the launcher mipmaps (D-373) and
# the release signing config (A11-16); web/ carries the SIMF title, description,
# icons and brand colours. `flutter create` CANNOT restore any of that, so this
# file ignores build OUTPUT and machine-local/secret files only.

# Dart / Flutter build output
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/
coverage/

# Generated code (if/when build_runner is used)
*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart

# Android build output / machine-local (android/.gitignore repeats these; kept
# here so a stray copy outside android/ is caught too)
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.cxx/
local.properties
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java

# Signing keys & service credentials — NEVER commit (NCA A11-16).
key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# iOS / macOS build output
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/xcuserdata/
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/Flutter/App.framework
**/Flutter/Flutter.framework

# Linux / Windows build output
**/flutter/ephemeral/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Clean-code refactor scratch — regenerable analyze/test dumps + helper script.
# The HANDOFF.md + census.md ledger stay tracked; the raw stdout captures don't.
.refactor/*.txt
.refactor/*.sed
